# Content Directory

Place your markdown blog posts here.

## Example Front Matter:

```markdown
---
title: "Your Blog Post Title"
excerpt: "A short description of your blog post"
date: "2025-01-15"
author: "Admin"
category: "Tips Travel"
image: "https://placehold.co/800x500/0077B6/FFFFFF?text=Your+Image"
published: true
---

Your blog post content goes here...
```
